      "id": "O0YJxlWgO1BPX7w5",
      "name": "Putrefaction",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "O0YJxlWgO1BPX7w5",
        "folder": "e96RfkchucyM8CyV",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Putrefaction",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You spoil the food and water nearby, even within your foes' bodies. Spend a Mythic Point. Enemies within 60 feet of you must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell] save against your class DC or spell DC (whichever is higher) or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1}. You also cause edible food to rot and potable water to turn brackish within the area. Choose a number of potions or alchemical elixirs within the area equal to your key attribute modifier and attempt a counteract against each of them using @Check[occultism] or @Check[religion] at mythic proficiency. Your counteract rank is half your level. If you succeed, the elixir or potion spoils and becomes a mundane item.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Apocalypse Rider Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
